sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    actor Admin as Administrator
    participant UI as Web Portal
    participant API as CategoriesController
    participant Service as CatalogService
    participant Store as CatalogStore
    participant DB as PostgreSQL Database

    %% ==========================================
    %% 1. VIEW PRODUCT CATEGORY TREE
    %% ==========================================

    Admin->>+UI: Open Product Category Management

    UI->>+API: List()
    API->>+Service: ListCategoriesAsync()

    Service->>+Store: ListCategoriesAsync()
    Store->>+DB: SELECT categories and parent relationships
    DB-->>Store: Category records
    deactivate DB

    Store-->>Service: Category list
    deactivate Store

    Service-->>API: Category hierarchy
    deactivate Service

    API-->>UI: Category list response
    deactivate API

    UI-->>Admin: Display category tree
    deactivate UI

    %% ==========================================
    %% 2. MANAGE PRODUCT CATEGORY TREE
    %% ==========================================

    opt Administrator manages category tree

        Admin->>+UI: Select category management action

        UI->>+API: Submit category management request

        API->>+Service: Invoke corresponding CatalogService operation

        alt Create Category

            Note over API,Service: CreateCategoryAsync()

            Service->>+Store: Validate parent and category uniqueness
            Store->>+DB: SELECT parent category and sibling categories
            DB-->>Store: Validation data
            deactivate DB

            Store-->>Service: Parent and uniqueness result
            deactivate Store

            alt Valid parent and hierarchy depth

                Service->>+Store: AddCategory() and SaveChangesAsync()
                Store->>+DB: INSERT new product category
                DB-->>Store: Category created
                deactivate DB

                Store-->>Service: Created category
                deactivate Store

            else Invalid parent, duplicate or depth exceeded

                Note right of Service: Reject category creation

            end

        else Update or Move Category

            Note over API,Service: UpdateCategoryAsync()

            Service->>+Store: Retrieve category and target parent
            Store->>+DB: SELECT category hierarchy
            DB-->>Store: Existing category tree
            deactivate DB

            Store-->>Service: Category and hierarchy data
            deactivate Store

            alt Valid update without cycle or depth violation

                Service->>+Store: Update category and SaveChangesAsync()
                Store->>+DB: UPDATE category name, parent or details
                DB-->>Store: Category updated
                deactivate DB

                Store-->>Service: Updated category
                deactivate Store

            else Circular hierarchy or invalid update

                Note right of Service: Reject invalid hierarchy change

            end

        else Activate or Deactivate Category

            Note over API,Service: SetCategoryStatusAsync()

            Service->>+Store: FindCategoryAsync(categoryId)
            Store->>+DB: SELECT category and current status
            DB-->>Store: Category record
            deactivate DB

            Store-->>Service: Current category
            deactivate Store

            alt Valid status change

                Service->>+Store: Update status and SaveChangesAsync()
                Store->>+DB: UPDATE category status
                DB-->>Store: Status updated
                deactivate DB

                Store-->>Service: Updated category
                deactivate Store

            else Category not found or change not permitted

                Note right of Service: Reject status change

            end

        else Delete Category

            Note over API,Service: DeleteCategoryAsync()

            Service->>+Store: Check category dependencies
            Store->>+DB: SELECT children, products and business references
            DB-->>Store: Dependency information
            deactivate DB

            Store-->>Service: Dependency validation result
            deactivate Store

            alt Category has no dependent records

                Service->>+Store: RemoveCategory() and SaveChangesAsync()
                Store->>+DB: DELETE product category
                DB-->>Store: Category deleted
                deactivate DB

                Store-->>Service: Deletion successful
                deactivate Store

            else Category has dependent records

                Note right of Service: Reject deletion and suggest deactivation

            end

        end

        Service-->>API: Operation result or business error
        deactivate Service

        API-->>UI: Success or error response
        deactivate API

        UI-->>Admin: Display result and refresh category tree
        deactivate UI

    end